    <statement><p>A)</p>
<p>Consider the vector field 
<m>F(x,y,z) = (5yz, -3xz, 8xy)</m>.</p>
<p>Find the divergence and curl of <m>F</m>.</p>
<p><m>\textrm{div}(F) = \nabla \cdot F =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.</p>
<p><m>\textrm{curl}(F) = \nabla \times F =  (</m> 
<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/>, <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/>,<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0004"/><m>)</m>.</p>
<p>B)</p>
<p>Consider the vector field 
<m>F(x,y,z) = (2x^2, 8(x+y)^2, -6(x+y+z)^2)</m>.</p>
<p>Find the divergence and curl of <m>F</m>.</p>
<p><m>\textrm{div}(F) = \nabla \cdot F =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0005"/>.</p>
<p><m>\textrm{curl}(F) = \nabla \times F =  (</m> 
<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0006"/>, <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0007"/>,<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0008"/><m>)</m>.</p>
</statement>
